'''Mount Aku''' is the 30th stage of [[The Aku Realms]]. When cleared for the first time, it drops an [[Catfruit|Aku Catfruit]], while also unlocking [[:Category:Malevolent Stages|awakening stages]] for [[:Category:Brainwashed Cats|Brainwashed Cats]] and [[Aku Reincarnation (Merciless)|Aku Reincarnation]].

After clearing [[Moon (Aku Realm)|Moon]], this stage will be [[Mount Aku (Aku Realm)/Invasion|invaded]] by [[Lord of Ruin Jagando]].

