==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]].
*1 [[Dark Priest Mamon]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Fallen Bear]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*6 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 53.33~56.67 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,700f</sup>.
*1 [[Fallen Bear]] spawns after 146.67 seconds<sup>4,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 75% HP:
**6 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This level is all about getting lucky with shield piercers. You should have [[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat)|Aku Researcher]] at this point, but [[Li'l Gross Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Macho Legs]] with the [[Shield Piercing]] [[Talents|Talent]] is a great bonus. Since Fallen Bear can one shot Erasers at level 29, you shouldn't bother with expensive meatshields. Due to this insanely high damage, it is important to not let the Fallen Bears near your base, as this will result in an almost instant loss.

