==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese Version]], this stage takes place on '''[[wikipedia:Mount Fuji|Mt. Fuji]]'''.
*Technically, Mount Aku is the only English [[Empire of Cats]] stage to take place in a fictional location.

